    {
      "_key": "visit-good-to-know",
      "_type": "richTextSection",
      "body": [
        {
          "_key": "gk-h1",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "gk-h1s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "What should I wear?"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "gk-a1-1",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "gk-a1-1s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Casual dress is welcome. People wear a variety of styles of clothes from short sleeves (especially in the summer), to suit jackets and “Sunday dresses.” Please dress comfortably and in a way which allows you to devote attention to worship."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "gk-h2",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "gk-h2s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "I’m not sure what I believe. Will that be a problem?"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "gk-a2-1",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "gk-a2-1s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "It won’t be a problem at all! Anyone is welcome to attend our time of Worship. You may participate (in singing, the prayers, in Sunday Bible study) as you wish."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "gk-h3",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "gk-h3s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Am I allowed to take the Lord’s Supper (communion)?"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "gk-a3-1",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "gk-a3-1s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "We believe it is the Lord’s table, and all who believe in him and have been baptized may partake. This includes believing Christians, no matter their particular denomination."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "gk-h4",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "gk-h4s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Does my child need to bring a Bible?"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "gk-a4-1",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "gk-a4-1s1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "No. But they are welcome to if they have their own. We will certainly provide a Bible if your child does not have one."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        }
      ],
      "heading": "Good to know"
    },
